        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">We recently switched MDN from <code class=\"notranslate\">yarn</code> to <code class=\"notranslate\">npm</code>. This PR updates mentions of <code class=\"notranslate\">yarn</code> and related commands to equivalent options using <code class=\"notranslate\">npm</code> in the writing guidelines.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To keep instructions up to date with the package manager being used</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/mdn/discussions/859\">https://github.com/orgs/mdn/discussions/859</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3652356968\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42048\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/42048/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42048\">#42048</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3671395447\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42149\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/42149/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42149\">#42149</a></li>\n</ul>",
