        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143106292?u=b3c5814362982b570863d2bb4e99cc0cc32ec862&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Mentions 'switch' attribute in input page.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ensures the reader is aware of the <code class=\"notranslate\">switch</code> attribute when visiting the input page.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #42885.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3848627069\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42885\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42885/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42885\">#42885</a></p>\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42888",
            "title": "Mention 'switch' attribute in input page",
            "date_modified": "2026-01-23T19:40:27.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-01-23T19:38:25.000Z",
