        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Update Device Memory docs:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>The APR rounds, not \"rounds down\"</li>\n<li>The limits may differ per browser</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">The first point was just wrong.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">And we recently update the spec to allow for these to change: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3543735086\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/device-memory/issues/50\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/device-memory/issues/50/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/device-memory/issues/50\">w3c/device-memory#50</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome is changing these limits in Chrome 146</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/6330376953921536\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/6330376953921536</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">BCD PR: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3848853651\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28900\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28900/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28900\">mdn/browser-compat-data#28900</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42887",
            "title": "Device memory updates",
            "date_modified": "2026-01-23T19:28:19.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-01-23T19:04:57.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "tunetheweb",
                "url": "https://github.com/tunetheweb"
            }
