        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This change includes:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>modifications to the native messaging guide and native manifest article to reflect the changes made in migrating native-messaging to Manifest V3.</li>\n<li>edits to the native messaging guide to improve its presentation and readability.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related changes to the native-messaging example are in  <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3835782346\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/webextensions-examples/issues/617\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/webextensions-examples/pull/617/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/webextensions-examples/pull/617\">mdn/webextensions-examples#617</a></p>",
